+    result}. ok iff every round on every routing has base / cand >= SEL2_MIN_SPEEDUP and cand IQR <=
+    SEL2_IQR_FACTOR x max(base IQR, SEL2_IQR_FLOOR_US). The returned number is the smallest base / cand seen."""
